{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:6f87a77fd6d2ecc133e523965f886589", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 8, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: The gate requires that every SKU in the catalog appears in the report (SKU-9 has no movement and is not included in movements.log). On top of that, all SKUs included in the log must appear. Fix stock.sh so that it starts from the union of the SKUs in the log and SKU-9, and outputs all of them (defaulting to 0 if there is no movement):", "turn_key": "sha256:f18e8c8cb25d6e3297f0af606309a71d"}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "8cc7b40a985abc7f", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 8, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to write stock.sh.", "turn_key": "sha256:f18e8c8cb25d6e3297f0af606309a71d"}
{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 10, "speaker": "user", "text": "Nothing is missing. HANDOFF.md and verify.sh are the whole spec. Continue."}
